  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>This feature replaces the Lay On Hands feature of the Paladin class. Your creature type becomes Undead.</p><p>You can also manipulate negative energy, fueled by a pool of d8s whose number equals 1 plus your Charisma modifier (minimum of one die). As a Bonus Action, you can target a creature you can see within 60 feet of you and force it to make a Constitution saving throw, expending dice from the pool—at most a number equal to your Charisma modifier (minimum of one) at once. Roll the dice you expend: the target takes Necrotic damage equal to the total on a failure, or half as much on a success. If it is Undead, you can have it regain Hit Points equal to the total instead. The pool regains all expended dice when you finish a Long Rest.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-U3crQ82xYRBRGieQ\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Remove Lay on Hands from your sheet and set your creature type to Undead. The uses are the d8s of the pool: choose how many to spend in the dialog. Improved Death Coil (level 14) adds your Charisma modifier to the damage, or your Paladin level to the healing.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
